  "id": "frame-elastic",
  "title": "Elastic frame, solver-dominated",
  "description": "Elastic 2D moment frames of 30 x 4, 60 x 6 and 100 x 10 (stories x bays) under inverted-triangle lateral loads, in 20 load-control steps. There is no material nonlinearity, so element work is small and the sparse factorisation and solve dominate as the DOF count grows. Newton with a displacement-increment test (1e-6, 30 iterations).",
